 " \[LongDash] ",
 "whether a walk is a geodesic at infra-scale s; scale 1 is InfraWalkQ and \
Infinity is InfraSegmentQ"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"e9434504-87fd-4e2a-8cd8-2fe87b07600d"]
}, Open  ]],

